<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Sumatra Crisis 2022 - Episode III: Singapore Surprise</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;FONT size=3 face="Times New Roman"&gt;In a final step to reduce merchant traffic providing help to Sumatran rebels, Indonesian Navy started placing mines&amp;nbsp;East of Palau Lingga Island in Malaccan Strait. Singapore Navy immediately moved heavily escorted mine countermeasures vessels (MCV) to remove the weapons&amp;nbsp;and establish full freedom of navigation in the area. This time Indonesia forces are ready to react in force and teach Singapore a harsh lesson.&amp;nbsp; &lt;BR&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;FONT size=3 face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Inspired by Harpoon4 book Sea of Dragons&lt;BR&gt;Scenario Author: Francesco Tomasinelli, &lt;/EM&gt;&lt;A href="mailto:ftomasinelli@gmail.com"&gt;&lt;EM&gt;ftomasinelli@gmail.com&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;FONT size=3 face="Times New Roman"&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;FONT size=3 face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;FONT size=3 face="Times New Roman"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
